    "title": "Word Connect",
    "description": "Word Connect is a fun and addictive offline word connect puzzle game!\r\nWhile enjoying this crossword puzzle game, you can train your brain and improve your vocabulary.\r\nPlay the most addicting word search game with your friends and pass your leisure time.\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY :\r\n- Find every word through the connection.\r\n- Complete all spaces to unlock the level.\r\n- Connect hidden words to get bonus coins.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Easy to play but challenging.\r\n- Daily bonus rewards.\r\n- 5000+ challenging levels in the word search.\r\n- Free 500 coins for this word puzzle game.\r\n- Play anytime,anywhere. No time and wifi limit.\r\n- The most addictive word games ever!\r\n\r\nTry it and train your brain with this new word puzzle game!",
